    "detailed_description": "You start the story on post apocalyptic Earth where you find an abandoned cathedral from where you can teleport yourself to <strong>7 various worlds</strong>. Every time you visit a new world you will take the form of a symbolic animal which respresents one of <strong>7 deadly sins</strong>. Each animal has its own unique ability which makes a huge difference to the gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/68fd1cba7c42d5351a814caeae488e85.poster.avif?t=1729016382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/68fd1cba7c42d5351a814caeae488e85.webm?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/68fd1cba7c42d5351a814caeae488e85.mp4?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you delve deeper into the game's narrative, you will face challenging platform elements and dangerous enemies that will require you to use all of your skills and wits to overcome.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/96998f34c38cd2bddbd19370470e550b.poster.avif?t=1729016382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/96998f34c38cd2bddbd19370470e550b.webm?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/96998f34c38cd2bddbd19370470e550b.mp4?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Take the form</strong> of a symbolic animal and <strong>learn</strong> how to fight 7 deadly sins and be a better <strong>You</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/327c6c7f8ca34cd9bf37e67cc4501038.poster.avif?t=1729016382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/327c6c7f8ca34cd9bf37e67cc4501038.webm?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/327c6c7f8ca34cd9bf37e67cc4501038.mp4?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ultimately, the game offers a compelling and rewarding experience for fans of exploration and adventure games, with a deep and engrossing storyline, memorable characters, and gorgeous visuals and music.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/230aba4df2cfa0b147581fb0c42a4855.poster.avif?t=1729016382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/230aba4df2cfa0b147581fb0c42a4855.webm?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/230aba4df2cfa0b147581fb0c42a4855.mp4?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Note: TOBI Path of Truth is being developed by a <strong>solo developer</strong> Andrzej Dybowski who works as an Art Director and Senior Concept Artist on a daily basis.<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "You start the story on post apocalyptic Earth where you find an abandoned cathedral from where you can teleport yourself to <strong>7 various worlds</strong>. Every time you visit a new world you will take the form of a symbolic animal which respresents one of <strong>7 deadly sins</strong>. Each animal has its own unique ability which makes a huge difference to the gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/68fd1cba7c42d5351a814caeae488e85.poster.avif?t=1729016382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/68fd1cba7c42d5351a814caeae488e85.webm?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/68fd1cba7c42d5351a814caeae488e85.mp4?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you delve deeper into the game's narrative, you will face challenging platform elements and dangerous enemies that will require you to use all of your skills and wits to overcome.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/96998f34c38cd2bddbd19370470e550b.poster.avif?t=1729016382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/96998f34c38cd2bddbd19370470e550b.webm?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413860/extras/96998f34c38cd2bddbd19370470e550b.mp4?t=1729016382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Take the form</strong> of a symbolic animal and <strong>learn</strong> how to fight 7 deadly sins and be a better <strong>You</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class